{"audio": "1corinthians-04.opus", "duration_ms": 179972, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3800, "text": "1 Corinthians, Chapter Four."}, {"start_ms": 5220, "end_ms": 10461, "text": "So then, men ought to regard us as servants of Christ and stewards of the mysteries of God."}, {"start_ms": 11221, "end_ms": 14361, "text": "Now it is required of stewards that they be found faithful."}, {"start_ms": 15141, "end_ms": 19821, "text": "I care very little, however, if I am judged by you or by any human court."}, {"start_ms": 20421, "end_ms": 22421, "text": "In fact, I do not even judge myself."}, {"start_ms": 23242, "end_ms": 26922, "text": "My conscience is clear, but that does not vindicate me."}, {"start_ms": 27442, "end_ms": 29162, "text": "It is the Lord who judges me."}, {"start_ms": 29862, "end_ms": 34822, "text": "Therefore judge nothing before the appointed time; wait until the Lord comes."}, {"start_ms": 35262, "end_ms": 40243, "text": "He will bring to light what is hidden in darkness and will expose the motives of men’s hearts."}, {"start_ms": 40683, "end_ms": 43563, "text": "At that time each will receive his praise from God."}, {"start_ms": 44343, "end_ms": 52624, "text": "Brothers, I have applied these things to myself and Apollos for your benefit, so that you may learn from us not to go beyond what is written."}, {"start_ms": 53384, "end_ms": 56564, "text": "Then you will not take pride in one man over another."}, {"start_ms": 57124, "end_ms": 58784, "text": "For who makes you so superior?"}, {"start_ms": 59464, "end_ms": 61964, "text": "What do you have that you did not receive?"}, {"start_ms": 62544, "end_ms": 66184, "text": "And if you did receive it, why do you boast as though you did not?"}, {"start_ms": 67204, "end_ms": 68745, "text": "Already you have all you want."}, {"start_ms": 69205, "end_ms": 70705, "text": "Already you have become rich."}, {"start_ms": 71205, "end_ms": 73125, "text": "Without us, you have become kings."}, {"start_ms": 73525, "end_ms": 77565, "text": "How I wish you really were kings, so that we might be kings with you!"}, {"start_ms": 78265, "end_ms": 85306, "text": "For it seems to me that God has displayed us apostles at the end of the procession, like prisoners appointed for death."}, {"start_ms": 86046, "end_ms": 90666, "text": "We have become a spectacle to the whole world, to angels as well as to men."}, {"start_ms": 91746, "end_ms": 95506, "text": "We are fools for Christ, but you are wise in Christ."}, {"start_ms": 96126, "end_ms": 98747, "text": "We are weak, but you are strong."}, {"start_ms": 99447, "end_ms": 101887, "text": "You are honored, but we are dishonored."}, {"start_ms": 102527, "end_ms": 109147, "text": "To this very hour we are hungry and thirsty, we are poorly clothed, we are brutally treated, we are homeless."}, {"start_ms": 109787, "end_ms": 111667, "text": "We work hard with our own hands."}, {"start_ms": 112107, "end_ms": 118728, "text": "When we are vilified, we bless; when we are persecuted, we endure it; when we are slandered, we answer gently."}, {"start_ms": 119528, "end_ms": 123848, "text": "Up to this moment we have become the scum of the earth, the refuse of the world."}, {"start_ms": 125028, "end_ms": 129049, "text": "I am not writing this to shame you, but to warn you as my beloved children."}, {"start_ms": 129789, "end_ms": 138809, "text": "Even if you have ten thousand guardians in Christ, you do not have many fathers; for in Christ Jesus I became your father through the gospel."}, {"start_ms": 139649, "end_ms": 141709, "text": "Therefore I urge you to imitate me."}, {"start_ms": 142369, "end_ms": 146630, "text": "That is why I have sent you Timothy, my beloved and faithful child in the Lord."}, {"start_ms": 147130, "end_ms": 153910, "text": "He will remind you of my way of life in Christ Jesus, which is exactly what I teach everywhere in every church."}, {"start_ms": 155010, "end_ms": 158531, "text": "Some of you have become arrogant, as if I were not coming to you."}, {"start_ms": 159071, "end_ms": 168031, "text": "But I will come to you shortly, if the Lord is willing, and then I will find out not only what these arrogant people are saying, but what power they have."}, {"start_ms": 168711, "end_ms": 172171, "text": "For the kingdom of God is not a matter of talk but of power."}, {"start_ms": 173032, "end_ms": 174032, "text": "Which do you prefer?"}, {"start_ms": 174632, "end_ms": 178632, "text": "Shall I come to you with a rod, or in love and with a gentle spirit?"}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 2320, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 2320, "e": 2980, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3080, "e": 3400, "si": 0}, {"t": "Four.", "s": 3520, "e": 3800, "si": 0}, {"t": "So", "s": 5220, "e": 5300, "si": 1}, {"t": "then,", "s": 5400, "e": 5600, "si": 1}, {"t": "men", "s": 5900, "e": 6120, "si": 1}, {"t": "ought", "s": 6300, "e": 6420, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 6460, "e": 6520, "si": 1}, {"t": "regard", "s": 6580, "e": 6960, "si": 1}, {"t": "us", "s": 7000, "e": 7120, "si": 1}, {"t": "as", "s": 7280, "e": 7380, "si": 1}, {"t": "servants", "s": 7501, "e": 7861, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 7901, "e": 7981, "si": 1}, {"t": "Christ", "s": 8041, "e": 8461, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 8561, "e": 8701, "si": 1}, {"t": "stewards", "s": 8781, "e": 9281, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 9321, "e": 9401, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 9421, "e": 9501, "si": 1}, {"t": "mysteries", "s": 9541, "e": 9961, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 10001, "e": 10081, "si": 1}, {"t": "God.", "s": 10141, "e": 10461, "si": 1}, {"t": "Now", "s": 11221, "e": 11421, "si": 2}, {"t": "it", "s": 11581, "e": 11661, "si": 2}, {"t": "is", "s": 11701, "e": 11801, "si": 2}, {"t": "required", "s": 11921, "e": 12381, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 12401, "e": 12481, "si": 2}, {"t": "stewards", "s": 12561, "e": 13061, "si": 2}, {"t": "that", "s": 13141, "e": 13281, "si": 2}, {"t": "they", "s": 13321, "e": 13421, "si": 2}, {"t": "be", "s": 13461, "e": 13541, "si": 2